OL,3,CSouthampton FC players 'fully behind'
OL,4,Cboss Tonda Eckert after Spygate scandal
OL,6,FSouthampton FC's captain Jack Stephens
OL,7,Fsays the team are "fully behind"
OL,8,Fmanager Tonda Eckert in the wake of
OL,9,Fthe spygate scandal, as the club
OL,10,Fprepare to start the new season.
OL,12,FSaints are due to play their first
OL,13,Fcompetitive match on Saturday (8
OL,14,FAugust) since being thrown out of the
OL,15,FChampionship Play-off Final in May.
OL,17,FEckert has taken full responsibility
OL,18,Ffor three spying missions against
OL,19,FChampionship opponents last season.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
