OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786110488
OL,3,CSouthampton FC players 'fully behind'
OL,4,Cboss Tonda Eckert after Spygate scandal
OL,6,FThe final one of these was against
OL,7,FPlay-off Semi Final opposition
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough.
OL,10,FThe English Football League (EFL)
OL,11,Fpunished Saints by throwing them out
OL,12,Fof the competition and giving them a
OL,13,Ffour-point deduction for this coming
OL,14,Fseason.
OL,16,FTomorrow (Saturday 8 August)
OL,17,FSouthampton play League 2 side
OL,18,FColchester United in the Carabao Cup.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
