PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786110488
OL,3,CSouthampton FC players 'fully behind'
OL,4,Cboss Tonda Eckert after Spygate scandal
OL,6,FAt the end of last season there had
OL,7,Fbeen reports that Saints' players were
OL,8,Fangry with Eckert, but Jack Stephens
OL,9,Fsays all the team are fully behind
OL,10,Ftheir manager.
OL,12,FThis support has been backed up by the
OL,13,Fsignings Southampton FC have made
OL,14,Fsince the Spygate scandal.
OL,16,FGoalkeeper Daniel Peretz and striker
OL,17,FCyle Larin both agreed deals a short
OL,18,Ftime after the club was expelled from
OL,19,Fthe play-offs, while James Bree signed
OL,20,Fa new three year contract.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1786110488
OL,3,CSouthampton FC players 'fully behind'
OL,4,Cboss Tonda Eckert after Spygate scandal
OL,6,FThe club also paid around #9 million
OL,7,Ffor forward Lewis Dobbin from Aston
OL,8,FVilla.
OL,10,FStephens says his the players are
OL,11,Flooking forward to the new season, but
OL,12,Fknow they need the backing of the fans
OL,13,Fif they're to achieve their ambition
OL,14,Fof automatic promotion up to the
OL,15,FPremier League.
OL,17,FSouthampton play Colchester United in
OL,18,Fthe Cup at 1730 on Saturday.
OL,20,FThey begin their Championship season
OL,21,Fnext Saturday at Watford.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/4
